 "caveats": [
  "POOLED event_study_relative_to_fee_start SUMS over a category set that shrinks with |e| (n_cat_months 9->6->1): sum_new_wallets / sum_wallets and the pooled median mix a treatment effect with panel composition, so the raw 317k->89k / $6.9->$2.9 trajectories overstate the fee response. Use event_study_balanced (constant category set, per-category means) and pretrend_diagnostic for inference; the pooled series is kept for continuity only.",
  "Fee-start derived from data (first month fee%>=thresh); confounds: crypto-vol regime, sports seasonality, platform growth, cross-category substitution \u2014 needs placebo/parallel-trends robustness. Lead with composition+incidence (volume elasticity likely ~null).",
  "Order = fills grouped to (taker,market,second,direction). Realised, descriptive."
 ]
